<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Smart Complaint Management System</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

</head>
<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial;
}

body{
background:#f4f7fb;
}

header{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
padding:20px 60px;
background:#0d6efd;
color:white;
}

nav a{
text-decoration:none;
color:white;
margin:15px;
}

.login{
padding:10px 20px;
border:none;
background:white;
color:#0d6efd;
border-radius:5px;
cursor:pointer;
}

.hero{
text-align:center;
padding:80px;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:45px;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero p{
font-size:20px;
margin-bottom:30px;
}

.hero button{
padding:15px 35px;
background:#0d6efd;
color:white;
border:none;
border-radius:8px;
font-size:18px;
}

.features{
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
gap:30px;
padding:40px;
}

.card{
width:300px;
background:white;
padding:30px;
border-radius:10px;
box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
text-align:center;
}

footer{
margin-top:50px;
padding:20px;
background:#0d6efd;
color:white;
text-align:center;
}
</style>

<body>

<header>

<div class="logo">
<h2>SCMS</h2>
</div>

<nav>

<a href="#">Home</a>
<a href="#">About</a>
<a href="#">Features</a>
<a href="#">Contact</a>

<button class="login">Login</button>

</nav>

</header>

<section class="hero">

<h1>Smart Complaint Management System</h1>

<p>
Register complaints, track their progress and resolve issues faster with one centralized platform.
</p>

<button>Get Started</button>

</section>

<section class="features">

<div class="card">

<h3>Register Complaint</h3>

<p>
Submit complaints in just a few clicks.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>Track Status</h3>

<p>
Know whether your complaint is Pending, In Progress or Resolved.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>Admin Dashboard</h3>

<p>
Admins can manage complaints easily.
</p>

</div>

</section>

<footer>

<p>
© 2026 Smart Complaint Management System
</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>